      "raw_locator": [
        {
          "book": "HEB",
          "chapter": 8,
          "verse": 7
        }
      ],
      "en": "For if that first covenant had been faultless, then no place would have been sought for a second.",
      "ko": "저 첫 언약이 무흠하였더면 둘째 것을 요구할 일이 없었으려니와",
      "source_text_hash": "b9c735e5cdc6be263f26d160d8e7f03315b89b946e703e15c80b961e51a87e5a",
      "translation_text_hash": "438a2d24295e85c3e692fa2672a33e6dddaec166584c32e513e6538e5b834f6a",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
      "source_edition": "KRV-1961",
      "mapping_type": "normal",
      "mapping_note": null,
      "raw_texts": [
        "저 첫 언약이 무흠하였더면 둘째 것을 요구할 일이 없었으려니와"
      ],
      "raw_text_hashes": [
        "438a2d24295e85c3e692fa2672a33e6dddaec166584c32e513e6538e5b834f6a"
      ]
    },
    {
      "canonical_locator": "bible:web:HEB:8:8",
      "sequence": 30097,
      "chapter_label": "HEB 8",
